# Restaurant POS API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5268

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get menu items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload menu image
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items/1/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Note: use REST client to attach file
